<title>UK: INSIGHT - Vulnerable gold to trade sideways for now.</title>
<headline>INSIGHT - Vulnerable gold to trade sideways for now.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> SPOT     NY CLOSE  * SUPPORT * RESIST * RSI14 *   MA10 *   MA30</p>
<p> GOLD   340.50/1.50 *  337.50 * 345.00 *    34 * 342.47 * 347.20</p>
<p> SILVER   4.69/4.71 *    4.60 *   4.85 *    33 *   4.73 *   4.92</p>
<p> PLAT   375.80/6.80 *  372.00 * 385.00 *    54 * 372.72 * 372.04</p>
<p>-----------------VIEWS FROM THE MARKET - April 25-------------</p>
<p>Gold prices were still stuck in a narrow range, but the market was looking increasingly likely to test $340 an ounce support as charts deteriorated, dealers said.</p>
<p>Platinum was also consolidating but would find good support around $372.00 in the near term, they added.</p>
